      "kind": "observation",
      "text": "Метод идентифицирует углеводороды по разнице водонасыщенностей.",
      "quote": "The ratio method identifies hydrocarbons from the difference between water saturations in the flushed zone (Sxo) and the uninvaded zone (Sw).",
      "unit": "u127-18"
