      "kind": "observation",
      "text": "Формирующий фактор сокращается.",
      "quote": "the formation factor (F = a/\\phi^m) is cancelled out of the equation because the same formation factor is used to calculate both Sw and Sxo.",
      "unit": "u127-27"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "kind": "observation",
      "text": "Индекс подвижных углеводородов определяется через отношение сопротивлений.",
      "quote": "from the ratio (Rxo/Rt)/(Rmf/Rw), the geologist can determine a value for both the moveable hydrocarbon index (Sw/Sxo) and water saturation by the ratio method without knowing porosity.",
      "unit": "u127-27"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "kind": "assumption",
      "text": "Показатель цементации принимается равным 2.0.",
